<h1 style="margin: 0px 0px 17.39px;padding-top: 25px;text-align: left;color: #fefefe;line-height: 1.3;font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 400;border-collapse: collapse !important;-ms-word-break: keep-all;-ms-word-wrap: normal;-ms-hyphens: none;-moz-hyphens: none;-webkit-hyphens: none;hyphens: none;">Azione richiesta per completare la registrazione a Intel&reg; Partner Alliance</h1>
</th>
