<br><p></p><p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"></p><table style="padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;">
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">{!Contact.FirstName},<br>
<br>congratulazioni, l'amministratore della tua azienda o un rappresentante Intel&reg; ti ha aggiunto a un account Intel&reg; Partner Alliance! Per completare la registrazione, ti mancano solo pochi passaggi.<br>
<br>Per il tuo profilo abbiamo creato le seguenti informazioni:<br>
</p><ul style="font-size: 11px;">
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Indirizzo e-mail:</b> {!Contact.Email}</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Nome azienda:</b> {{ACCOUNTNAME}}</li>
<li style="font-size: 11px;"><b>Business ID Intel&reg; Partner Alliance:</b> {{ACCOUNTNUMBER}}</li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Clicca sul link sottostante per completare la registrazione</p>
<p class="btn-spacer" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 0; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 0px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"></p>
