<tr><td style="word-break:break-all;line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;color: #555554; ">Se hai qualche domanda, contattaci all'indirizzo <a href="{{SUPPORTLINK}}" style="color:#FF0000;">{{SUPPORTLINK}}</a>.</td></tr><!--<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/partner" style="color:#FF0000;">Verify now</a><br>--><tr><td style="line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;color: #555554; ">Non vediamo l'ora di averti nel programma!<br>Cordiali saluti,<br>Il tuo team Intel&reg; Partner Alliance<p></p></td></tr>

